<section class="account-page shell-narrow"><div class="account-card care-page"><p class="eyebrow">Client care</p><h1>Size guide</h1><p>Use these measurements as a general guide. Individual product fits may vary.</p><div class="admin-table-wrap"><table class="admin-table"><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Bust cm</th><th>Waist cm</th><th>Hip cm</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>XS</td><td>80–84</td><td>62–66</td><td>86–90</td></tr><tr><td>S</td><td>85–89</td><td>67–71</td><td>91–95</td></tr><tr><td>M</td><td>90–94</td><td>72–76</td><td>96–100</td></tr><tr><td>L</td><td>95–101</td><td>77–83</td><td>101–107</td></tr><tr><td>XL</td><td>102–108</td><td>84–90</td><td>108–114</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>For personal sizing assistance, contact client care before ordering.</p><a class="button button-dark" asp-action="Contact">Ask about sizing</a></div></section>
